# The assessment of AGT-001 against this build. The requirement identifier is this
# file's stem and appears nowhere inside it, because a second place to spell the identity
# is a second place for it to be wrong -- the rule OD-SPEC-007 chose for a record
# registration, and CHK-003.assessment states for this registry.
#
# AGT-001: "Before agent work, Nomos shall produce a typed task envelope containing goal,
# scope, authoritative knowledge context, applicable rules, prohibited changes, available
# tools, and expected output schema." Seven named parts.
#
# 'Authoritative knowledge context' is ARC-ECOSYSTEM-001's own worked example of substance
# that is genuinely KWB's, not Nomos's -- "What did a source or a decision claim? KWB." --
# so that clause does not bind this registry and is left out of this verdict rather than
# forced NotBinding for the whole requirement.
#
# Of the remaining six, two are real today: `LedgerItem` is exactly the goal (`title`/`why`)
# and scope (`territory`) an agent is handed before claiming and working an item, the
# concrete shape a task already takes here. 'Applicable rules' has a real analog one layer
# up, in a gate run's `RuleSelector`/`ScopeSelector` -- but nothing wires either onto a
# per-task envelope. No single typed envelope bundles any of this into one artifact.
#
# 'Prohibited changes', 'available tools', and an actual output-schema type (not prose) have
# no real site: `Claim` carries only who holds an item and when the lease lapses, nothing
# about what tools that holder may use. `WorkflowStep` does carry a typed `SchemaId`-shaped
# output schema, but for a workflow step, not a ledger item or an agent task -- nothing
# connects the two.
verdict: Partial
site: crates/substrate/nomos-ledger/src/item.rs#LedgerItem
site: crates/substrate/nomos-scope-verification/src/territory.rs#Territory
site: crates/orchestration/nomos-gate-orchestration/src/rule_selector.rs#RuleSelector
site: crates/orchestration/nomos-gate-orchestration/src/scope_selector.rs#ScopeSelector
gap: crates/substrate/nomos-ledger/src/claim.rs#Claim
gap: crates/contracts/nomos-contracts/src/workflow_step.rs#WorkflowStep
